COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_methods.elicitation_tradeoff IS 'What the method gives up (accuracy or depth) and what it gains (practicality or reach).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_methods.semantic_type_iri IS 'Semantic type IRI.';

