COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.previous_term_iri IS 'The IRI before the standard changed its prefix or identifier.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.evaluation_context IS 'Instant the model is judged against.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.deprecated_by_source IS 'TRUE when the source standard marks the term deprecated.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.deprecated_at IS 'When the source deprecated it.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN external_standard_terms.still_resolves IS 'TRUE when the deprecated IRI still dereferences.';
