COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.method_holder IS 'The party that holds how it is built or performed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.sourced_since IS 'When the current execution arrangement began.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN sourcing_functions.sourcing_rationale IS 'Why the function was placed where it is (CoreCompetencyFocus, CostReduction, Capability).';
