COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_holdings.holder_is_veteran IS 'TRUE when the holder is a long-tenured practitioner.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_holdings.handles_exception_or_discretion IS 'TRUE when the knowledge resolves an exception or a discretionary decision.';
