COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.organization IS 'The organization whose know-how this is.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.procedure IS 'The procedure the know-how serves.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.community_of_practice IS 'The community in which the know-how circulates.';
