COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.holder_agent IS 'The person who carries it, when the carrier is a person.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.holder_facility IS 'The plant that carries it in its layout and equipment, when the carrier is a facility.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.know_how_kind IS 'WhatFails, Diagnosis, Improvisation or Refinement: the kind of practitioner know-how.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.is_in_written_procedure IS 'TRUE when the know-how is written into a procedure.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN know_how_carriers.is_trained_skill IS 'TRUE when the know-how is carried as trained skill of seasoned workers.';
