COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_repository_entries.author_agent IS 'Who wrote the entry.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_repository_entries.source_expert IS 'Whose expertise the entry records.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN knowledge_repository_entries.credits_source_expert IS 'TRUE when the entry names and credits the source expert.';
